#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/recovery_codes-provision.html:71
msgid "Ensure that you have securely stored them before continuing."
msgstr "Kontrollera att du har sparat dem säkert innan du fortsätter."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:4
msgid "Create API token"
msgstr "Skapa API-token"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:23
#, python-format
msgid "Token for \"%(macaroon_description)s\""
msgstr "Token för ”%(macaroon_description)s”"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:25
#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:156
msgid "Upload packages"
msgstr "Ladda upp paket"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:28
#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:174
msgid "Entire account (all projects)"
msgstr "Hela kontot, alla projekt"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:30
#, python-format
msgid "Project \"%(project)s\""
msgstr "Projektet ”%(project)s”"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:37
msgid ""
"For security reasons this token will only appear once. <strong>Copy it "
"now.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Av säkerhetsskäl visas denna token bara en gång. <strong>Kopiera den "
"nu.</strong>"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:46
msgid "Copy token"
msgstr "Kopiera token"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:63
msgid "Using this token"
msgstr "Använda denna token"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:64
msgid "To use this API token:"
msgstr "Så här använder du denna API-token:"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:70
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Set your password to the token value, including the <code>%(prefix)s</code> "
"prefix"
msgstr ""
"Ange tokenvärdet, inklusive prefixet <code>%(prefix)s</code>, som lösenord"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:75
#, python-format
msgid ""
"For example, if you are using <a href=\"%(href)s\">Twine</a> to upload your "
"projects to PyPI, set up your <code>%(filename)s</code> file like this:"
msgstr ""
"Om du till exempel använder <a href=\"%(href)s\">Twine</a> för att ladda upp"
" projekt till PyPI konfigurerar du filen <code>%(filename)s</code> så här:"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:85
#, python-format
msgid ""
"For example, if you are using <a href=\"%(href)s\">Twine</a> to upload "
"multiple projects to PyPI, you can set up your <code>%(filename)s</code> "
"file like this:"
msgstr ""
"Om du till exempel använder <a href=\"%(href)s\">Twine</a> för att ladda upp"
" flera projekt till PyPI kan du konfigurera filen <code>%(filename)s</code> "
"så här:"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:97
msgid ""
"either a user-scoped token or a project-scoped token you want to set as the "
"default"
msgstr ""
"antingen en användarbegränsad token eller en projektbegränsad token som du "
"vill använda som standard"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:104
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You can then use <code>%(command)s</code> to use the correct token when "
"uploading to PyPI."
msgstr ""
"Du kan sedan använda <code>%(command)s</code> för att använda rätt token när"
" du laddar upp till PyPI."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:110
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Twine also supports other ways to provide credentials, including keyring "
"integration. See the <a href=\"%(twine_docs_href)s\">Twine authentication "
"documentation</a> for details."
msgstr ""
"Twine har även stöd för andra sätt att ange autentiseringsuppgifter, "
"inklusive nyckelringsintegrering. Mer information finns i <a "
"href=\"%(twine_docs_href)s\">Twines dokumentation om autentisering</a>."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:115
#, python-format
msgid ""
"When publishing from a supported automated environment, consider using <a "
"href=\"%(trusted_publishing_href)s\">Trusted Publishing</a> instead of "
"manually managing API tokens."
msgstr ""
"När du publicerar från en automatiserad miljö som stöds kan du överväga att "
"använda <a href=\"%(trusted_publishing_href)s\">betrodd publicering</a> i "
"stället för att hantera API-token manuellt."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:120
#, python-format
msgid ""
"For further instructions on how to use this token, <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">visit the PyPI help page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Mer information om hur du använder denna token finns på <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">PyPI:s hjälpsida</a>."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:189
msgid ""
"An API token scoped to your entire account will have upload permissions for "
"all of your current and future projects."
msgstr ""
"En API-token med hela kontot som omfattning har uppladdningsbehörighet för "
"alla dina nuvarande och framtida projekt."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/totp-provision.html:17
#, python-format
msgid ""
"PyPI supports any application that follows the <a href=\"%(href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><abbr title=\"time-"
"based one-time password\">TOTP</abbr> standard</a>."
msgstr ""
"PyPI har stöd för alla appar som följer <a href=\"%(href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><abbr "
"title=\"tidsbaserat engångslösenord\">TOTP-standarden</abbr></a>."
